bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Login Page" as UI
boundary Router
control AuthController
control AuthService
control UserService
entity UserModel
boundary HashUtil
boundary JwtService
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Enter email & password\nClick Login
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. POST /api/auth/login (loginDto)
activate Router

Router -> AuthController: 3. login(loginDto)
activate AuthController

AuthController -> AuthService: 4. login(loginDto)
activate AuthService

ref over AuthService, MongoDB: 5. Subsequence - Find user for email login

loop User not found / Account not verified / Account banned / Google account detected
    AuthService --> AuthController: 5.1. Throw BadRequestException
    AuthController --> Router: 5.2. HTTP 400 response
    Router --> UI: 5.3. Show error
    UI --> User: 5.4. Invalid credentials
end

AuthService -> HashUtil: 6. Compare password
activate HashUtil
HashUtil --> AuthService: 7. Result
deactivate HashUtil

opt Password mismatch
    AuthService --> AuthController: 8.1. Throw BadRequestException
    AuthController --> Router: 8.2. HTTP 400 response
    Router --> UI: 8.3. Show error
    UI --> User: 8.4. Invalid credentials
end

AuthService -> JwtService: 9. Generate JWT access token
activate JwtService
JwtService --> AuthService: 10. Result
deactivate JwtService

AuthService --> AuthController: 11. Return token & payload
deactivate AuthService

AuthController --> Router: 12. Set-Cookie
deactivate AuthController

Router --> UI: 13. Login success 
deactivate Router

UI --> User: 14. Redirect to home page
deactivate UI
deactivate User
@enduml